  "prompt": "Which categories make at least 60% as much net revenue on the web as in stores? Use the sales table and its category_name column; channel is 'web' or 'store'. Return three columns, in this order: category_name, web_revenue_eur, the sum of net_revenue_eur over the category's web lines, and store_revenue_eur, the sum of net_revenue_eur over its store lines. Lines with a missing net_revenue_eur add nothing. Return one row per category_name, and only the categories whose web_revenue_eur is at least 0.6 times their store_revenue_eur. Do not round. Any row order is fine.",
